# Used only by `npm run build:mobile` (vite --mode mobile), which is what
# mobile-app/'s own build script runs before every native sync — the normal
# `npm run build` (web deployment) never reads this file and stays
# same-origin as it always has.
#
# Point this at your real, publicly reachable backend origin (no trailing
# slash) — the native app's webview is never same-origin with this API, so
# a relative /api/... call has nothing to reach. See backend/.env.example's
# CLIENT_URL_MOBILE for the matching backend-side setup.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://sci-check.turjo-jaman.com

